            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">This dataset can be used in the construction building sector. The cutting of the extruded polystyrene blocks is not included in the process. Blowing agent shares are 50% (w/w) CO2, 25% (w/w) HFC-134a and 25% (w/w) HFC-152a.;
Synonyms: XPS; 
UUID: dcf7ce1d-09d1-3157-aeef-58a010bbc0bd</common:generalComment>
